in arXiv:2201.11669, and Rui-Jun Huang, Xiao Liu and Yan-Qing Ma in
arXiv:2607.08477. Algorithmic credit belongs to these authors.

Reference: AMFlow 2.0, commit 26005517a288086c4cb4d1b26d829691bc088485
https://gitlab.com/multiloop-pku/amflow

